    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimusabe Uwiteka imvura mu gihe cy'itumba, muyisabe Uwiteka urema imirabyo, na we azabavubira imvura y'umurindi, umuntu wese azamumereza ubwatsi mu rwuri rwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko ibishushanyo bisengwa bivuga ubusa n'abapfumu bakaragura ibinyoma, abanyenzozi bakabeshya bagahumurisha abantu ubusa, ni cyo gituma abantu bazimira nk'intama, bakababara cyane kuko batagira umwungeri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uburakari bwanjye bukongerejwe abungeri kandi nzahana amasekurume y'ihene, kuko Uwiteka Nyiringabo aje gusura umukumbi we ari wo nzu ya Yuda, azabahindura nk'ifarashi ye nziza mu ntambara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muri we hazaturuka ibuye rikomeza imfuruka, muri we hazaturuka n'urubambo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". Muri we hazaturuka n'umuheto w'intambara, kandi muri we ni ho hazaturuka abatware bose hamwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bo bazamera nk'intwari ku rugamba iyo ziribatira ababisha mu byondo byo mu mayira, bazarwana kuko Uwiteka ari kumwe na bo, abagendera ku mafarashi bazamwara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ab'inzu ya Yuda nzabaha imbaraga, kandi ab'inzu ya Yosefu nzabakiza mbagarure kuko mbababariye, bazamera nk'abatigeze gucibwa kuko ndi Uwiteka Imana yabo, nzajya mbumvira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abefurayimu bazamera nk'intwari, bazishima mu mitima nk'uwishimira vino. Ni koko abana babo bazabireba banezerwe, imitima yabo izanezererwa Uwiteka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzabahamagaza ikivugirizo mbateranye kuko nabacunguye, kandi bazagwira nk'uko bagwiraga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzababiba mu mahanga, bazanyibuka bari mu bihugu bya kure, bazabana amahoro n'abana babo kandi bazagaruka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzongera mbakure no mu gihugu cya Egiputa, mbateranye mbakure muri Ashuri, maze mbageze mu gihugu cy'i Galeyadi n'i Lebanoni, ndetse ntihazabakwira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azanyura mu nyanja y'umubabaro, akubite imiraba yo mu nyanja. Imuhengeri ha Nili hazakama, ubwibone bwa Ashuri buzacishwa bugufi, n'inkoni y'umwami wa Egiputa izavaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanjye nzabaha gukomerera mu Uwiteka, na bo bazagendera mu izina rye. Ni ko Uwiteka avuga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
